<title>USA: Old National Bancorp sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Old National Bancorp sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Old National Bancorp said Thursday it had declared a five percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The company also said it reaffirmed a continuing authorization to repurchase up to five percent of its outstanding shares.  </p>
<p>The dividend is payable January 29, record January 8.</p>
<p>For purposes of broker trading, the ex-dividend date is January 6, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
